Package: com.example.multitaskfloat
Name: Multitask Float Bar for LiveContainer
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Simplifies LiveContainer multitasking windows: a draggable floating pill with only the minimize, maximize and close buttons, no side multitask dock, plus pin-to-front, left-edge docking for pinned windows, and a one-tap multitask dot in the app list.
Maintainer: Local build
Author: Local build
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
